# Umbral Collar Zealot: "Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Surveil 1." On turn 3 the Zealot is the only creature or
# artifact Bot1 has, so its ability is not offered (`!`): "another" excludes the Zealot itself. On turn 5, after Bot1 casts
# Llanowar Elves, the same ability is offered (the positive control): the Elves is sacrificed (a cost, CR 602.2b), Bot1 surveils 1
# and puts the Mountain on top of its library into the graveyard. The Zealot survives.

